    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the award-winning creator of Mad Experiments: Escape Room 1 &amp; 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a brand-new first-person escape-room adventure for 1\u20134 players (60\u201390 min). A forsaken convent hides the Horn of the Fallen One, Scepter of Radiance, and Abbot\u2019s Ring behind a web of ritual, light, and music trials\u2014will you reclaim them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless cross-platform co-op</strong> \u2013 PC, Mac, and Linux players team up instantly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-relic quest</strong> \u2013 unite Horn, Scepter, and Ring on the altar to open the final door. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature set-piece puzzles</strong> \u2013 bend a mirror-guided light beam, ring a bell melody, and piece together the abbots\u2019 chronology. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden-prison finale</strong> \u2013 uncover a sealed passage beneath the cloisters for one last, pulse-pounding challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced narrative</strong> \u2013 every clue and revelation delivered by professional performers. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the award-winning creator of Mad Experiments: Escape Room 1 &amp; 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a brand-new first-person escape-room adventure for 1\u20134 players (60\u201390 min). A forsaken convent hides the Horn of the Fallen One, Scepter of Radiance, and Abbot\u2019s Ring behind a web of ritual, light, and music trials\u2014will you reclaim them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless cross-platform co-op</strong> \u2013 PC, Mac, and Linux players team up instantly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-relic quest</strong> \u2013 unite Horn, Scepter, and Ring on the altar to open the final door. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature set-piece puzzles</strong> \u2013 bend a mirror-guided light beam, ring a bell melody, and piece together the abbots\u2019 chronology. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden-prison finale</strong> \u2013 uncover a sealed passage beneath the cloisters for one last, pulse-pounding challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced narrative</strong> \u2013 every clue and revelation delivered by professional performers. </p></li></ul>",
